      "Spearman corr(frac_anchored, trial mean pupil dilation) = -0.26 (p=0.000), n=225 trials\n",
      "population-anchored trials (n=122): mean pupil dilation=25.36\n",
      "population-non-anchored trials (n=103): mean pupil dilation=25.59\n",
